# License

This repository ships **mixed** licenses. Do **not** treat the whole tree as pure MIT.

## Application source code

Unless noted otherwise, original TypeScript / JavaScript / documentation authored for this project
(`src/` game & HUD logic, `bin/`, `src/cli/` runtime, build scripts) is provided under the terms of the
**MIT License** (see below).

## Runtime pixel assets (`public/assets/`)

| Asset | License / constraint |
| --- | --- |
| WorkAdventure-style office tiles (`maps/tilesets/*.png`, excluding unused village bulk) | [CC-BY-SA 3.0](http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/) — Valdo Romao / WorkAdventure starter maps. Share-alike for derivative maps; do **not** redistribute tiles as a standalone asset pack. |
| `maps/tilesets/village/fountain-sculptures.png` and `decor-rugs-1.png` | Used by the office map only; same WA / village asset terms as upstream. The published npm package **does not** include the full wa-village world tileset tree. |
| `maps/tilesets/world-stub.png` + runtime `world-map.json` | Project-authored 25×25 color stub (blue floor / white exit) for map switching; no wa-village HQ art. |
| Pipoya character atlas (`characters.png`) | [Pipoya FREE RPG Character Sprites 32x32](https://pipoya.itch.io/pipoya-free-rpg-character-sprites-32x32) — personal/commercial use OK; **do not** redistribute or resell the original sprite pack. This repo only ships the assembled atlas. |
| Fusion Pixel font (`public/fonts/*.woff2`) | [SIL Open Font License 1.1](https://github.com/TakWolf/fusion-pixel-font/blob/master/LICENSE-OFL) |

See also [`public/assets/CREDITS.md`](public/assets/CREDITS.md).

## npm package `@huyuan/pixel-office`

The published tarball contains a prebuilt SPA (`dist/`), CLI entrypoints, and the allowlisted assets above.
It **does not** contain the wa-village headquarters map or the bulk of `tilesets/village/`.
It **does not** contain the `art/` authoring workspace.

